Fonts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sammelband uses two typefaces licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). The web app serves them from the
@fontsource-variable packages, and the PDF export embeds them in every PDF it
creates, from the @expo-google-fonts packages. The full license text comes
with each package.

Noto Sans
Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
(https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic)

Playfair Display
Copyright 2017 The Playfair Display Project Authors
(https://github.com/clauseggers/Playfair-Display), with Reserved Font Name
"Playfair Display"

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTICE files of dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Docker image contains the server's dependencies under /app/node_modules,
each with its own license file. Of the Apache-2.0 licensed packages among
them, only TypeScript by Microsoft Corp. (the typescript package and its
@typescript/typescript-<platform> binary) comes with a NOTICE file. It lists
the third-party material TypeScript incorporates and is included in the image
unchanged, at
/app/node_modules/.bun/typescript@<version>/node_modules/typescript/NOTICE.txt
